## The Work

**Creator Spotlight: Thao Nguyen, @makersmark.studio**

Thao runs a one-person ceramics studio out of a shared workshop space in Portland. She's been selling on her own site for two years, after a decade of giving her work away to friends and listing one-offs on Etsy when the rent got tight.

What changed: she started sharing her process — not just finished pieces, but cracks, misfires, glazes that went wrong. Her Instagram following is modest (just over 4,000). Her waitlist for custom pieces is four months long.

*"People don't buy the pot. They buy the feeling that a real person made it."*

